 @rolandmoot4108  the most impressive thing is the latency and single core.

28 cycles for L3 cache while Skylake and derivative Intel Core desktop chips are beyond 150 cycles. I get 376 CPU-Z single thread score.

No CPU on the market besides the Apple M1 is so amazing in latency , single thread speed and efficency, it clocks very similar to my 4700MQ and the same power consumption, just shows how strong the IPC is and how Intel stagnated the CPU industry with Skylake and did nothing for 5 years besides adding more cores. For this reason, the Apple M1 exists.

 @telquel7843  Most tech youtubers also don't have the perspective of an average buyer, they don't have to hunt for MSRP priced cards and their basis for actual prices only come from ebay, so of course they can trash budget cards all day long.

A gt 1030 is 120 cad where I am, are you seriously going to tell me that's worth it? A gtx 1050 ti is 270 cad, and a 1650 is 350 cad. And this is better than a 1650, it's nearest to the 1650 super as long as the vram isn't saturated.

For 350 cad I would buy this card and be happy with my purchase, because my next choice would be a 1650 or a 530 cad 1660. 1650 super isn't even available here.
